#: ../../c-api/apiabiversion.rst:91
msgid "Version"
msgstr "Version"

msgid "``Py_PACK_FULL_VERSION`` arguments"
msgstr "``Py_PACK_FULL_VERSION`` の引数"

msgid "Encoded version"
msgstr "エンコードされたバージョン"

msgid "``(3, 4, 1, 0xA, 2)``"
msgstr "``(3, 4, 1, 0xA, 2)``"

msgid "``0x030401a2``"
msgstr "``0x030401a2``"

msgid "``(3, 10, 0, 0xF, 0)``"
msgstr "``(3, 10, 0, 0xF, 0)``"

msgid "``0x030a00f0``"
msgstr "``0x030a00f0``"

msgid ""
"Out-of range bits in the arguments are ignored. That is, the macro can be "
"defined as:"
msgstr ""
"引数の範囲外のビットは無視します。\n"
"つまり、このマクロは次のように定義できます。"

msgid ""
"#ifndef Py_PACK_FULL_VERSION\n"
"#define Py_PACK_FULL_VERSION(X, Y, Z, LEVEL, SERIAL) ( \\\n"
"   (((X) & 0xff) << 24) |                              \\\n"
"   (((Y) & 0xff) << 16) |                              \\\n"
"   (((Z) & 0xff) << 8) |                               \\\n"
"   (((LEVEL) & 0xf) << 4) |                            \\\n"
"   (((SERIAL) & 0xf) << 0))\n"
"#endif"
msgstr ""
"#ifndef Py_PACK_FULL_VERSION\n"
"#define Py_PACK_FULL_VERSION(X, Y, Z, LEVEL, SERIAL) ( \\\n"
"   (((X) & 0xff) << 24) |                              \\\n"
"   (((Y) & 0xff) << 16) |                              \\\n"
"   (((Z) & 0xff) << 8) |                               \\\n"
"   (((LEVEL) & 0xf) << 4) |                            \\\n"
"   (((SERIAL) & 0xf) << 0))\n"
"#endif"

msgid ""
"``Py_PACK_FULL_VERSION`` is primarily a macro, intended for use in ``#if`` "
"directives, but it is also available as an exported function."
msgstr ""
"``Py_PACK_FULL_VERSION`` は主に ``#if`` ディレクティブで使うためのマクロです"
"が、エクスポートされた関数としても利用できます。"

msgid ""
"Equivalent to ``Py_PACK_FULL_VERSION(major, minor, 0, 0, 0)``. The result "
"does not correspond to any Python release, but is useful in numeric "
"comparisons."
msgstr ""
"``Py_PACK_FULL_VERSION(major, minor, 0, 0, 0)`` と同等です。\n"
"結果は実際の Python リリースには対応しませんが、数値による比較に便利です。"
